\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\rSacred Shield\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩLoot the Libram of Deliverance from a book on the bench inside the building. Equip the Libram and follow its instructions to receive the rune.\000\000\000w\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ\"\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Focused Rage\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩKill Witherbark Trolls until Witherbark Mallet drops, use it on the gong inside of the cave to summon an Witherbark Goliath and two adds. Kill the Goliath and loot it to receive the rune.\000\000\000ÔøΩÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000@\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Spirit of the Alpha\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩStarting at Freewind Post, take the northern and then the lower bridge to see a chest on a pillar. Either in Ghost Wolf form or with a different speed boost, jump down and loot the chest.\000\000\000nÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000~ÔøΩ\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Empowered Renew\000\000\000\000\000\000\000@Defeat Grimtotem Tauren or Crushridge Ogres to receive the rune.\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000ÔøΩ\000*\000*\000*\000*	\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ\"\000\000\000\000\000\000\000~ÔøΩ\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Steady Shot\000\000\000\000\000\000\0004Kill Needletooth, then loot him to receive the rune.\000\000RÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\0