00\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Fire Nova: Step 5\000\000\000\000\000\000\0004Talk to Tal in Thunder Bluff to travel to Moonglade.\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ'\000\000\000\000@\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Fire Nova: Step 6\000\000\000\000\000\000\000?Talk to Keeper Remulos in Moonglade to receive Elemental Salve.\000\000\000.8\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ'\000\000\000\000@\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Fire Nova: Final Step\000\000\000\000\000\000\0008Loot the Elemental Salve and use it to receive the rune.\000\000\000ÔøΩÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ'\000\000\000\000@\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Power Surge\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩDefeat Boulderfist Ogre to receive a Ogre Lightning Rod and place it in the Soft Soil on top of the mountain. Then hit the Lightning Rod with Lightning Bolt ten times to summon Tam'kar. Defeat him to receive the rune.\000\000\000ÔøΩÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ'\000\000\000\000@\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩe\000\000\000\000Decoy Totem\000\000\000\000\000\000!Collect either 3 Cloud Serpent Fangs from any Cloud Serpent or 10 Strong Harpy Feather from any Harpy. Bring these together with a Silken Thread (e.g. bought from Jandia in Freewind Post) to the altar and create the Offering to the Wind Spirit. Then jump off the cliff to receive the rune.\000\000RS\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ'\000\000\000\000\000\000\000r\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000y@\000\000\000\000Enlightened Judgements\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩKill Humanoids in Arathi Highlands and collect Tarnished Prayer Bead I, II and III. Purify all three before combining them to the Rosary of the Light, which you bring to Brother Atticus in Stromgarde Keep.\000JPurify Bead I: Cast Blessing of Might while in combat and defeat an enemy.\0009Purify Bead II: Cast Divine Shield with less than 10% HP.\000<Purify Bead III: Unleash Seal of Justice on a fleeing enemy.\000\000Q+\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ'\000\000\000\000\000\000\000r\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Guarded by the Light\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩLoot the Dormant Holy Rune, cast Divine Intervention (anywhere) and be resurrected by another player before releasing your spirit to receive the rune.\000\000\000wÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ'\000\000M\000\000\000\000r\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Aeonas Whereabouts\0008D\000\0008I\000\000?Talk to Harold Riggs to find out more about Aeonas whereabouts.\000\000\000k\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩ'\000\000\000\000\000\000\000~ÔøΩ\000\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000ÔøΩ\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000\000yÔøΩÔøΩ\000\000\000\000Invigoration\000\000\000\000\000\000\000ÔøΩBuy an Entomology Starter Kit to receive a Bug Catching Net and a Field Guide. Then catch all three bugs listed in the Field Guide and bring them to Amaryllis Webb.\000\000QD\000\000\000\